                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": 718,
                          "content": "DevFest.cz 2026 takes place on 30 October 2026 at Uhelný Mlýn — a converted industrial mill in Libčice nad Vltavou, just outside Prague. Doors open at 9:00, the last talk ends around 18:00, and the afterparty runs into the night. Nearby train stops are on the S4 line from Praha–Masarykovo nádraží.",
